<p>Supplemental and Explanatory Information</p>
<p>(1)  Basis of Consolidation: The consolidated financial statements include the accounts of Winn-Dixie Stores, Inc., and its subsidiaries which operate as a major food retailer in fourteen states and the Bahama Islands.</p>
